                        "glosses": [
                            "A bibliographer’s catalogue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5296d50c-aead-4f41-ba24-d95ac7e0bb90",
                                "sense_id": "c4ec7e5c-1372-3fb6-bb58-ca0aaa4008e7",
                                "text": "But if they, who are of this Opinion, would but Reflect a little upon the Materials which the Learn’d Men of this Age have afforded by their Bibliothecs, Hiſtorical Dictionaries and Journals, they would quickly perceive their Miſtake. By their Bibliothecs I do not here mean their Libraries, but their Elaborate Compoſures Publiſh’d under that Title, ſuch as the New Eccleſiaſtical Bibliothec of M. Du Pin, wherein we have an Abſtract of all the Works of the Eccleſiaſtical Writers, who have liv’d ſince the Birth of our Saviour till the Beginning of the laſt Age; which truly is a Work of ſuch Labour and Learning, that it is deſervedly eſteem’d one of the beſt Eccleſiaſtical Hiſtories that ever the World had."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
